      ******************************************************************
      *  TC24 -- 0300-DALYREJS-OPEN error branch (status 35)
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C 0300-DALYREJS-OPEN error status 35'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '35' TO DALYREJS-STATUS
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
            PERFORM 0300-DALYREJS-OPEN
