      ******************************************************************
      *  TC25 -- 0400-ACCTFILE-OPEN success branch (status 00)
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C 0400-ACCTFILE-OPEN success status 00'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '00' TO ACCTFILE-STATUS
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
