      ******************************************************************
      *  TC28 -- 0500-TCATBALF-OPEN error branch (status 35)
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C 0500-TCATBALF-OPEN error status 35'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '35' TO TCATBALF-STATUS
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
            PERFORM 0500-TCATBALF-OPEN
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 12
            EXPECT IO-STATUS TO BE '35'
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' HAPPENED ONCE

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC29 -- 1000-DALYTRAN-GET-NEXT happy read (status 00)
